{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109003","id":2697315804,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6gxcXc","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109003","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109003.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109003.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109003","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109003/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109003/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109003/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b7b67aec8a6f360c3b247915b24863380baa2d89","number":109003,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add fast `Array` <-> `Vector<Variant>` conversions.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`Array` uses `Vector<Variant>` as backing. We can expose this fact for performance boost in some situations. Especially:\r\n\r\n- Convert `Array` to `Vector<Variant>` with a CoW copy instead of a full copy\r\n    - This conversion is called a bunch of times throughout the codebase. One caller is `bindv`, which this should noticeably accelerate.\r\n- Convert `Vector<Variant>` to `Array` with a CoW copy instead of a full copy\r\n\r\nBoth of these use-cases should go from `O(N)` to `O(1)`.\r\nThere might be more use-cases through the code base, but these are the only ones I found.\r\n\r\nIt could be argued that `Array` should not expose the fact that it is using `Vector` as backing, but I think it won't change anytime soon:\r\n- It has been so for a long time.\r\n- We cannot use any other type because it needs to be CoW based.\r\n- Contiguous `Variant` storage is required because even though it can be typed, access can still be untyped.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.",